# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and host-built
# artifacts out of the image.

# Host node_modules would shadow the image's own — and carries Prisma engines
# built for the HOST's libc, which is the whole reason the API image pins a glibc
# base. Letting these in reintroduces the mismatch silently.
**/node_modules

# Build output — regenerated inside the image.
**/dist
**/.next

# Secrets. .env files are mounted at runtime via EnvironmentFile= in the Quadlet
# units, never baked into a layer (a layer is readable by anyone who can pull it).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
certs/
*.pem
*.key

# Runtime data.
server/uploads/

# Not needed to build or run.
.git
.github
.claude
deploy/
*.md
**/*.test.ts
